# Ex1  2-chlorophenol  UKS PBE/def2-TZVP  CPCM water
# Opt + analytic Freq. Charges, dipole, orbital energies and 298.15 K thermochemistry
# (entropy) are all printed by default.
# PBE has no HF exchange, so only RI-J (def2/J) is needed
! UKS PBE def2-TZVP def2/J TightSCF TightOpt Opt Freq CPCM(Water)

%maxcore 6000

* xyzfile 0 1 ../2Cl_phenol_cis_start_geometry.xyz
